@startuml
title State diagram for the Ott Based System Mini Reel class

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle
Idle : entry/To action
Idle : do/Remain in same state
Idle : exit/Create Account / Watch Videos

state "Create Account" as CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry/Register
CreateAccount : do/Register after validating
CreateAccount : exit/Login/Invalid registration

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry/Login
Login : do/Login using valid username and password
Login : exit/Invalid login/To home page

state "Invalid login" as InvalidLogin
InvalidLogin : entry/Invalid login
InvalidLogin : do/Cannot login
InvalidLogin : exit/Abnormal termination

state "Watch Videos" as WatchVideos
WatchVideos : entry/To home page
WatchVideos : entry/Watch videos after creating account
WatchVideos : exit/Upload Video / Save to Likes List

state "Upload Video" as UploadVideo
UploadVideo : entry/Upload video
UploadVideo : do/Upload video
UploadVideo : exit/Save to Likes List / View Saved Videos

state "Save to Likes List" as SaveToLikesList
SaveToLikesList : entry/Save video to likes list
SaveToLikesList : do/Save video to likes list
SaveToLikesList : exit/View Saved Videos / Enter Discussion Option

state "Enter Discussion Option" as EnterDiscussionOption
EnterDiscussionOption : entry/Enter discussion option
EnterDiscussionOption : do/Enter discussion option
EnterDiscussionOption : exit/View Saved Videos / Upload Video

state "Invalid login" as InvalidLogin
InvalidLogin --> [*]

WatchVideos --> SaveToLikesList
SaveToLikesList --> ViewSavedVideos
UploadVideo --> SaveToLikesList
SaveToLikesList --> EnterDiscussionOption
EnterDiscussionOption --> ViewSavedVideos
EnterDiscussionOption --> UploadVideo

[*] --> CreateAccount
CreateAccount --> Login
Login --> WatchVideos

@enduml
